/farmland-atlas/nebraska/dawson-county"],["ARC or PLC in Dawson County","/arc-plc/nebraska/dawson-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 20% of normal in November to December and 147% in June to July. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 12% of normal on the middle.</p>"}
